# Package ownership policy
#
# Every Plugin Source Package must be covered by an explicit ownership entry
# naming exactly its declared Package Maintainers, e.g.:
#
#   /plugins/example.plugin/ @inferst @fluxta/maintainers
#
# Wildcard and repository-default entries never satisfy package ownership.
# The validation seam rejects packages whose ownership routing is missing or
# mismatched.
#
# The default entry below routes repository-level review to repository
# maintainers. It does not count as package ownership.

* @inferst
/plugins/obs/ @inferst
